
VADDR        TYPE     PRIVILEGE    PADDR        STATUS / RESULT               
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
0x00100004   READ     USER         0x00100004   [SUCCESS] Translated
0x00100008   WRITE    USER         0x00100008   [SUCCESS] Translated
0x00101000   WRITE    USER         0x--------   [FAULT] Protection Violation (Write to Read-Only Page)
0x00102000   READ     USER         0x--------   [FAULT] Protection Violation (User Access to Supervisor Page)
0x00102000   READ     SUPERVISOR   0x00102000   [SUCCESS] Translated
0x00103000   READ     USER         0x--------   [FAULT] Page Fault (Page Not Present in Memory)
